mediate effect and pay one month\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\'s salary in lieu of&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">notice, or&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">Accept the resignation effective on any day during the notice period and&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">compensate for the remaining days, if applicable.</span></li></ul><p>9. Other Work</p><p>You are required to devote your full working time and attention exclusively to the company.&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">You may not undertake any other employment or consultancy work without prior written&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">approval from the company.</span></p><p>10. Conflict of Interest</p><p>You shall not engage, directly or indirectly, in any business activity with competitors during&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">your employment or for a period of six (6) months after cessation of employment.</span></p><p>11. Confidential Information</p><p>You must maintain strict confidentiality of all company-related information during and after your&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">employment, unless disclosure is legally required.</span></p><p>12. Disciplinary Action</p><p>Violation of company policies may result in verbal or written warnings, suspension, or&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">termination, depending on the severity of the misconduct.</span></p><p>If any company property (such as systems, mouse, keyboard, or other issued materials) is&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">damaged or mishandled, action may be taken under the Information Technology Act (ITA), and&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">recovery of damages may be pursued.</span></p><p>13. On Termination</p><p>Upon termination of employment, you must immediately return all company assets,&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">documents, and materials in your possession and must not retain or reproduce any copies.</span></p><p>14. Exit Policy</p><p>Employees wishing to resign are required to serve a 30-day notice period from the date of&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">resignation to ensure a smooth handover and proper knowledge transfer. A documented&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">handover of responsibilities is mandatory.&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">The full and final settlement will be processed within 40 days from the last working day, subject&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">to the return of all company assets and completion of exit formalities. If all handover formalities&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">are completed on time, the company will issue the experience letter, salary slips, and other&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">required documents within 10 days from the last working day.</span></p><p>15. Amendments</p><p>These terms and conditions are governed by the company\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\'s current HR policies and may be&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">amended or revised from time to time. Employees will be informed of such changes as&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">applicable.</span></p><p>Please confirm your acceptance of this appointment and the above terms by signing a copy of&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">this letter and returning it to us.</span></p><p>We warmly welcome you to the Vibrantick family and look forward to a long, successful, and&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">mutually rewarding association.</span></p><p>Note:</p><p>If you leave immediately, whether you are an intern or an employee, the following terms&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\">will apply:</span></p><ul><li>Interns are required to serve a prior notice period of 7 days.</li><li>Employees are required to serve a notice period of 30 days.</li></ul><p>Failure to serve the applicable notice period will result in you not being eligible for salary, salary slips, or&nbsp;<span st