INSERT INTO `offer_letter_content` (`id`, `description`, `updated_at`, `created_at`, `letter_type`) VALUES
(5, '<p>This is with reference to your application and subsequent interview with Vibrantick&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">Infotech Solutions. We are pleased to appoint you as a [designation]</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">.</span></p><p>The Following terms and conditions will govern your employement:-</p><p><b>1. Monthly Gross Salary</b></p><p>You will be paid a monthly gross salary of [salary]/-, along with a 5% incentive on every sale&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">generated directly by you.</span></p><p><b>2. Working Hours</b></p><p>Your working hours will be from 10:00 AM to 6:30 PM, Monday to Friday, in accordance with&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">the company\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\'s current policy.</span></p><p><b>3. Date of Appointment</b></p><p>Your date of appointment, as per company records, will be [doj].</p><p><b>4. Salary Increase</b></p><p>Your salary will be reviewed periodically as per company policy. Any increment will depend on&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">your performance and contribution during the review period and will be subject to individual&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">performance, overall business conditions, and final management approval.</span></p><p><b>5. Probation Period</b></p><p>You will be on probation for three (3) months from the date of joining. Upon satisfactory&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">completion, you will be confirmed in service. If confirmation is not provided within six months,&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">the probation period will automatically extend until further notice.</span></p><p><b>6. Leave</b></p><p>You will be governed by the company\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\'s current Leave Policy applicable to permanent&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">employees.</span></p><p><b>7. Responsibilities</b></p><p>You are expected to fulfill all assigned responsibilities diligently and effectively. Your&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">performance will be reviewed regularly as per the Company Performance Management&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">System.</span></p><p><b>8. Notice Period</b></p><ul><li>During probation: Either party may terminate the appointment by providing seven<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">(7) days\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\' notice or seven days\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\' salary in lieu of notice.</span></li><li>Upon confirmation: The notice period will be one (1) month, or one month\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\'s salary&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">in lieu of notice, by either party.</span></li><li>In the case of resignation after confirmation, the company reserves the right to:</li><li>Accept the resignation with immediate effect and pay one month\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\'s salary in lieu of&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">notice, or&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">Accept the resignation effective on any day during the notice period and&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">compensate for the remaining days, if applicable.</span></li></ul><p><b>9. Other Work</b></p><p>You are required to devote your full working time and attention exclusively to the company.&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">You may not undertake any other employment or consultancy work without prior written&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">approval from the company.</span></p><p><b>10. Conflict of Interest</b></p><p>You shall not engage, directly or indirectly, in any business activity with competitors during&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">your employment or for a period of six (6) months after cessation of employment.</span></p><p><b>11. Confidential Information</b></p><p>You must maintain strict confidentiality of all company-related information during and after your&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">employment, unless disclosure is legally required.</span></p><p><b>12. Disciplinary Action</b></p><p>Violation of company policies may result in verbal or written warnings, suspension, or&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">termination, depending on the severity of the misconduct.</span></p><p>If any company property (such as systems, mouse, keyboard, or other issued materials) is&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">damaged or mishandled, action may be taken under the Information Technology Act (ITA), and&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">recovery of damages may be pursued.</span></p><p><b>13. On Termination</b></p><p>Upon termination of employment, you must immediately return all company assets,&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">documents, and materials in your possession and must not retain or reproduce any copies.</span></p><p><b>14. Exit Policy</b></p><p>Employees wishing to resign are required to serve a 30-day notice period from the date of&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">resignation to ensure a smooth handover and proper knowledge transfer. A documented&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">handover of responsibilities is mandatory.&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">The full and final settlement will be processed within 40 days from the last working day, subject&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">to the return of all company assets and completion of exit formalities. If all handover formalities&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">are completed on time, the company will issue the experience letter, salary slips, and other&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">required documents within 10 days from the last working day.</span></p><p><b>15. Amendments</b></p><p>These terms and conditions are governed by the company\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\'s current HR policies and may be&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">amended or revised from time to time. Employees will be informed of such changes as&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">applicable.</span></p><p>Please confirm your acceptance of this appointment and the above terms by signing a copy of&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">this letter and returning it to us.</span></p><p>We warmly welcome you to the Vibrantick family and look forward to a long, successful, and&nbsp;<span style=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;background-color:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\" transparent;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"=\\\"\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\\\\\&quot;\\\\&quot;\\\">mutually rewarding association.</span></p><p><span style=\\\"background-color: transparent;\\\">HR</span></p><p>Vibrantick Infotech Solutions</p>', '2026-06-06 12:30:06', '2026-06-06 07:00:06', 'employee');
